# Paths that define how AI agents work in this repository.
#
# tests/ holds the acceptance criteria for agent-written code. An agent that
# weakens a test to make it pass changes the definition of "done", so a human
# owner reviews every change here. The same applies to the agent rules
# (CLAUDE.md, .cursorrules), agent permissions (.claude/), and CI gates.
#
# Replace the account with your team, e.g. @your-org/maintainers.
# GitHub assigns no reviewer for an owner that does not exist.

